  - 开头叙述结构与主角：
    - “The story follows the life and career of Frank Prescott—the influential headmaster of the prestigious 
Justin Martyr School. It begins with Brian Aspinwall, a former student of Justin Martyr, reflecting on his 
experiences and the impact Frank Prescott had on his life. Aspinwall serves as the narrator providing insights 
into Prescott's character and the events that shaped him.”  
    - 注意：这里将 Brian 描述为“former student”；与 EBSCO 将其定位为 1939 
年到校的教师略有差异，后续编写时需由主代理对该点进行谨慎比对。
  
